<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 6/7.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 6/7.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 7. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.08.97	  06.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4156	    6.5234</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1195	    2.1399</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.1814	    4.2254</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3561	    3.3738</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4937	    0.4962</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7117	    0.7172</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2650	    0.2676</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.6834	    6.7987</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6889	    0.6891</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1450	    1.1511</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
